text:
This looks like flaked tuna mixed with chopped vegetables (red onion, celery or green pepper, red pepper) in a large metal bowl. There is no visible mayo. The bowl is about 25 cm across, and the food mound covers roughly 12 cm. I estimate about 250 g of tuna and 50 g of vegetables, so about 300 g total.

Canned tuna in water has roughly 110-130 kcal per 100 g. At 250 g that is about 290 kcal. The vegetables add about 15 kcal. Some oil or dressing may be present, so I'm rounding up to about 330 kcal.

